OL,3,GNEWSASwinney asks prime minister for
OL,4,Alegal mechanism for independence vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister John Swinney has written
OL,7,Fto the prime minister inviting him to
OL,8,Fmeet and consider the constitutional
OL,9,Ffuture of Scotland.
OL,11,FSwinney's letter calls for a legal
OL,12,Fmechanism to be established for
OL,13,Ftriggering an independence vote
OL,14,Ffollowing comments from Andy Burnham
OL,15,Fwhich some have interpreted as a
OL,16,Fsoftening of his stance on the issue.
OL,18,FBurnham told MPs on Wednesday that both
OL,19,Fin Scotland and Northern Ireland, a
OL,20,Fborder poll would be considered if
OL,21,Fpublic opinion had changed and there
OL,22,Fwas a clear consensus.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
