OL,3,GNEWSASwinney asks prime minister for
OL,4,Alegal mechanism for independence vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut he added that he did not believe
OL,7,Fthat had happened, and Downing Street
OL,8,Flater insisted there was no change in
OL,9,Fhis position that such a vote was
OL,10,Fcurrently "off limits".
